alth access.', 'Active'), ('CFV_SDG03_TVET_002', 'TVET', 'For all health-related fields', 'Promote public health values such as prevention, inclusion and sustainability.', 'Active'), ('CFV_SDG03_TVET_003', 'TVET', 'For all health-related fields', 'Recognise health as a human right and a shared community responsibility.', 'Active'), ('CFV_SDG03_TVET_004', 'TVET', 'Health and social care/community health work', 'Promote empathy and confidentiality in client care.', 'Active'), ('CFV_SDG03_TVET_005', 'TVET', 'Health and social care/community health work', 'Empower individuals to take charge of their health.', 'Active'), ('CFV_SDG03_TVET_006', 'TVET', 'Health and social care/community health work', 'Recognise and respect cultural and faith-based health-promoting practices in client care, ensuring that health interventions are inclusive, respectful and aligned with individuals’ cultural and spiritual beliefs.', 'Active'), ('CFV_SDG03_TVET_007', 'TVET', 'Public and environmental health', 'Promote responsibility for sustainable practices that protect long-term community health.', 'Active'), ('CFV_SDG03_TVET_008', 'TVET', 'Public and environmental health', 'Advocate for environmental justice.', 'Active'), ('CFV_SDG03_TVET_009', 'TVET', 'Hospitality and food services', 'Be accountable for food safety and client wellbeing.', 'Active'), ('CFV_SDG03_TVET_010', 'TVET', 'Hospitality and food services', 'Take pride in serving healthy, nutritious and culturally appropriate meals.', 'Active'), ('CFV_SDG03_TVET_011', 'TVET', 'Agriculture and food safety', 'Take stewardship of food systems that support nutrition and wellbeing.', 'Active'), ('CFV_SDG03_TVET_012', 'TVET', 'Agriculture and food safety', 'Promote ethical responsibility in pesticide and antibiotic use.', 'Active'), ('CFV_SDG03_TVET_013', 'TVET', 'Emergency and disaster response', 'Be calm under pressure and prioritise human life.', 'Active') ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;